  "unvalidated_hypotheses": [
    "early_target_hunt arms on trend plus consolidation and defers execution to target_seeking_breakout.",
    "target_seeking_breakout is the executable breakout continuation for the same consolidation context.",
    "structural_reaction, cascade_impulse, and fresh_extreme_momentum are conservative v2-only hypotheses that still obey one-attempt and causal expiry rules.",
